## 4. Overflow Menu Implementation

### Cross-Platform Solution
Use `react-native-action-sheet` for consistent behavior across platforms:
- iOS: Maps to native ActionSheetIOS
- Android: Shows material design dropdown menu
- Web: Falls back to modal dialog

```tsx
import ActionSheet from 'react-native-action-sheet';

const handleOverflowPress = () => {
  ActionSheet.showActionSheetWithOptions(
    {
      options: ['Compartir', 'Eliminar', 'Cancelar'],
      destructiveButtonIndex: 1, // Delete is destructive
      cancelButtonIndex: 2,
      title: 'Más opciones'
    },
    async (buttonIndex) => {
      switch (buttonIndex) {
        case 0: // Share
          await handleShare();
          break;
        case 1: // Delete
          await handleDelete();
          break;
        case 2: // Cancel
          break;
      }
    }
  );
};
```

### Delete Flow
```typescript
const handleDelete = async () => {
  // Confirmation dialog
  const confirmed = await Alert.alert(
    'Eliminar concierto',
    '¿Estás seguro de que quieres eliminar este concierto de tus guardados?',
    [
      { text: 'Cancelar', style: 'cancel' },
      { text: 'Eliminar', style: 'destructive', onPress: async () => {
        try {
          await supabase
            .from('events')
            .delete()
            .eq('id', event.id);
            
          // Refresh events
          await refreshEvents();
          
          Toast.show({
            type: 'success',
            text1: 'Concierto eliminado',
            text2: 'El concierto ha sido eliminado de tus guardados'
          });
        } catch (error) {
          Toast.show({
            type: 'error',
            text1: 'Error',
            text2: 'No se pudo eliminar el concierto'
          });
        }
      }}
    ]
  );
};
```

### Share Flow
```typescript
import * as Share from 'react-native-share';

const handleShare = async () => {
  try {
    const shareOptions = {
      title: `¡Mira este concierto!`,
      message: `Te recomiendo ver a ${event.artist?.name} en ${event.venue} el ${formatDate(event.date)}.`,
      url: event.url || undefined // Only include if available
    };
    
    await Share.open(shareOptions);
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Share failed:', error);
    Toast.show({
      type: 'error',
      text1: 'Error',
      text2: 'No se pudo compartir el concierto'
    });
  }
};
```

